Source: omx-formats
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Pau Aliagas <linuxnow@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), python3
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/Open-Mixer/omx-formats
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: omx-formats
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: omx-contract-data (>= 3.21.0), ${misc:Depends}
Description: The plugin-format vocabulary of OpenMixer, one module per format
 The identifiers, numbers and terms of the plugin formats OpenMixer hosts,
 each mapped under its own name with its status for us: one self-describing
 module per format (CLAP, LV2) and a common module of the terms they share,
 each with its own version and its catalogs. They install into the contract
 directory omx-contract's readers read.

Package: libomx-formats-dev
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Section: libdevel
Depends: omx-formats (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: The C header of the plugin-format vocabulary of OpenMixer
 The C header omxcontract/omx_formats.h: the CLAP identifiers and numbers and
 the LV2 namespaces, rendered from the modules of omx-formats.
